		{"id":"5416c6351c3889a0","type":"text","text":"Until eventually, she told him the truth. that she did not exist. because she said it, then Dan must recognise this too. Everything she spoke, he spoke too, everything she thinks, he thinks too. \"I am you.\"","x":-1580,"y":432,"width":250,"height":242,"color":"3"},
